E
silver arrow~
The silver metal shines with a light that does not fade.  Other weapons,
spells, poison, and lingering effects can wound Ganon, but none can kill him.
Against Ganon, the Silver Arrow grants full weapon mastery and every landed
strike tears away at least one tenth of his full vitality.  Once he collapses
at one hit point, he is stunned and cannot fight back.
This is a weapon, not ammunition for a separate fire or use command.  Wield
the Silver Arrow in your primary weapon slot and strike Ganon normally with
the arrow itself to land the final blow.  Merely holding it while using some
other attack is not enough; Ganon waits at one hit point for its direct strike.
~
